WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.275 --> 00:00:06.709
Maya is talking, but the little green orb does not understand one word!

3
00:00:07.448 --> 00:00:10.714
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:13.835
This is Episode 92.

5
00:00:14.574 --> 00:00:16.508
Meet the swap-bridge.

6
00:00:17.247 --> 00:00:19.158
Maya says something.

7
00:00:19.897 --> 00:00:23.529
It crosses the bridge, and comes out in the orb's language.

8
00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:26.060
The orb answers.

9
00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:30.290
It crosses back, and comes out in Maya's language.

10
00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.249
Back and forth, faster and faster.

11
00:00:34.988 --> 00:00:37.123
Now they can chat all day.

12
00:00:37.862 --> 00:00:39.642
A whole sentence?

13
00:00:40.381 --> 00:00:43.011
It crosses in order, every word.

14
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.097
That is Amazon Translate.

15
00:00:46.836 --> 00:00:50.456
It turns words from one language into another, fast.

16
00:00:51.195 --> 00:00:53.377
Now you know the swap-bridge!

17
00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

